  description: 'Cannot be Normal Summoned/Set. Must first be Special Summoned (from
    your hand) while you control no monsters. When this card is Special Summoned
    from the hand: You can Special Summon 2 "Vague Shadow Tokens" (Winged Beast-Type/DARK/Level
    1/ATK 0/DEF 0), but they cannot be Tributed or be used as Synchro Material. You
    can banish this card and 1 or more face-up non-Tuners you control, then target
    1 "Blackwing" Synchro Monster in your Graveyard whose Level equals the total
    Levels the banished monsters had on the field; Special Summon it, and if you
    do, it is treated as a Tuner.'
